  ✓ Stage 4: audit claim adequacy and real-program pinning
  ✓ Stage 5: inventory and review every K declaration and rule
  → Stage 6: create and run a fresh meaningful false mutation
  • Stage 7: account for proven versus assumed boundaries and write REVIEW.md
